  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Combine rhubarb, sugar, blueberries, vanilla extract, and cinnamon stick in a pot; add enough water to barely cover mixture. Simmer, stirring occasionally, until rhubarb is soft and broken down, 30 to 40 minutes. Discard cinnamon stick.",
